=begin

    A buddy script to start bigshot quick if targets available and you have Claim to the room

        author: elanthia-online
          game: Gemstone
          tags: combat, bigshot
      required: Lich >= 5.21.0
       version: 1.0.0

    changelog:
      1.0.0 (2026-10-09)
        - Initial release

=end

Group.check if Group.broken? or !Group.checked?

loop do 
  if !GameObj.targets.to_a.empty && Claim.mine?
    Script.run("bigshot", "quick")
  end
  sleep(0.5)
end